-- Pale Reach quests whose progress or turn-in window was empty: the realm's English text as carried by the
-- AscensionES translation addon (HideXs/AscensionES, data/Quests.lua, fields pEN and cEN). Where both it and the
-- world database have text they agree for 97% of Pale Reach quests, and its progress texts match live footage.
-- The addon shows $N, $C, $R and $g as words; those are turned back into tokens here. It drops text after an
-- unclosed angle bracket and one-word angle text, so a stage direction may be missing from a few of these.
-- Two progress texts (175037, 175057) are Spanish in the addon's English field and are translated back from it;
-- one spelling slip is corrected (175114 'breath'); 175099 is left out, as its field holds an objective line.
-- The 175142 turn-in gets back its first stage direction, which the addon lacks (video RIEMlZSgbQw 10:55:14).

